\@writefile{toc}{\contentsline {subsection}{\numberline {3.1}Problem Formulation and Graph Representation}{5}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{sec:formulation}{{3.1}{5}}
\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces End-to-end architecture of OUEG-RAG. (1) Multi-source ingestion retrieves relevant table rows and candidate hyperlink passages. (2) Dynamic schema multigraph instantiates star centroids $\rho _i$ and deterministic text relations ($<20$\tmspace  +\thinmuskip {.1667em}ms). (3) Two-tier controlled reasoning engine: Tier\nobreakspace  {}1 evaluates the lossless compressed multigraph with guided reading path $p_1$. Confident outputs yield an immediate verified span (Fast Exit, 1 call); ambiguous or incomplete queries emit a structured diagnostic handoff (\texttt  {NEED\_FOCUS}), triggering targeted symmetric bridge retrieval and a minimal L2 state capsule. (4) Grounded answer generation and verified provenance trace.}}{6}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:pipeline}{{2}{6}}
\@writefile{toc}{\contentsline {paragraph}{Online Evidence Multigraph Representation.}{6}\protected@file@percent }
